IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CONTROL.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-I       PIC 9(3)   VALUE 0.
01 WS-SUM     PIC 9(5)   VALUE 0.
01 WS-FACT    PIC 9(9)   VALUE 1.
01 WS-GRADE   PIC X(1)   VALUE "B".
01 WS-AREA    PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-W       PIC 9(3)   VALUE 4.
01 WS-H       PIC 9(3)   VALUE 5.
01 WS-FLAG    PIC X(1)   VALUE "Y".
   88 IS-ON   VALUE "Y".
   88 IS-OFF  VALUE "N".

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    PERFORM SUM-LOOP VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 5.
    DISPLAY "Sum 1..5: " WS-SUM.

    MOVE 1 TO WS-FACT.
    PERFORM FACT-STEP VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 5.
    DISPLAY "5!: " WS-FACT.

    MULTIPLY WS-W BY WS-H GIVING WS-AREA.
    DISPLAY "Area: " WS-AREA.

    EVALUATE WS-GRADE
        WHEN "A" DISPLAY "Excellent"
        WHEN "B" DISPLAY "Good"
        WHEN "C" DISPLAY "Pass"
        WHEN OTHER DISPLAY "Unknown"
    END-EVALUATE.

    IF IS-ON THEN
        DISPLAY "Flag is on"
    END-IF.

    PERFORM 3 TIMES
        DISPLAY "tick"
    END-PERFORM.

    STOP RUN.

SUM-LOOP.
    ADD WS-I TO WS-SUM.

FACT-STEP.
    MULTIPLY WS-I BY WS-FACT GIVING WS-FACT.
